6. **Trim the NDA (Oil & Gas) Role**: Reduce to 2 bullets that demonstrate real-time ML at scale: keep the anomaly detection (12% downtime reduction) and the digital twin (scalable backend with Python, K8s, Kafka). Remove the energy efficiency bullet to reduce industrial focus and free space for more relevant content.

